 Four weeks of vacation, well-being days and a Monday to Friday schedule to support work-life balance; 
 An allowance for professional membership fees, paid professional development days and clinical supervision to support your growth;  
 A pension plan to help you reach your retirement goals; 
 One volunteering day to support a cause that's important to you; 
 A positive work environment that supports diversity and inclusion;  
 Access to exclusive TELUS employee advantages.  
 A bit about us 
